{
  "env": "dev",
  "account_id": "f011d0ee02b23cad26b4b38151b204ad",
  "zone": "yonedarepo.com",
  "workers_subdomain": "mlong-f01",
  "prefix": "yonedarepo-dev",
  "ref": "dev",
  "secrets_file": "~/.config/yonedarepo/staging.env",
  "vars": {
    "origin": "https://dev.yonedarepo.com",
    "ratelimit": "2001"
  },
  "check_instances": 4,
  "workers": [
    {
      "role": "superfan",
      "file": "wrangler.dev-superfan.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Dev superfan: the cheap-model watcher (cloudflare/superfan) of the dev platform Worker",
        "(yonedarepo-dev-platform), with its own ledger and a $1/day cap. It keeps the platform's tail",
        "events and, hourly, reads the GraphQL Analytics API. The Durable Object namespace, queue and",
        "CheckContainer ids it queries are looked up by name at run time (no ids in this config), so",
        "CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN needs Account Analytics Read plus Workers Scripts Read, Queues Read and",
        "Containers Read (all read-only). Secrets, set from stdin (~/.config/yonedarepo/staging.env):",
        "CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN  API token with the read permissions above",
        "SUPERFAN_READ_TOKEN bearer for GET /findings, GET /status, POST /run",
        "Deployed first: the dev platform names this Worker in tail_consumers."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN",
        "SUPERFAN_READ_TOKEN"
      ],
      "ephemeral": false,
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-superfan",
        "main": "superfan/index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        },
        "triggers": {
          "crons": [
            "7 * * * *"
          ]
        },
        "vars": {
          "CF_ACCOUNT_ID": "{account_id}",
          "WATCH_SCRIPT": "{prefix}-platform",
          "WATCH_URL": "https://{prefix}-platform.{subdomain}.workers.dev",
          "TELEMETRY_SOURCE": "cloudflare",
          "SUPERFAN_MODEL": "mimo-v2.6-flash",
          "MIMO_TOKEN_PLAN_REGION": "sgp",
          "DAILY_CAP_MICROUSD": "1000000"
        },
        "secrets_store_secrets": [
          {
            "binding": "MIMO_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "MiMo"
          },
          {
            "binding": "ZAI_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "ZAI"
          }
        ],
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "LEDGER",
              "class_name": "SuperfanLedger"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "SuperfanLedger"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "platform",
      "file": "wrangler.dev-platform.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Dev platform Worker (dev.yonedarepo.com stack): the source platform, with its own",
        "Durable Object namespaces, Artifacts namespace, R2,",
        "D1, queues, workflow, check containers and secrets, so it shares nothing with production",
        "(yonedarepo-prod-*). Browsers reach it through the dev agent Worker's",
        "/api/v1 proxy (PLATFORM service binding); workers.dev stays on for direct API benches.",
        "OWNER_TOKEN  dev-only owner credential (~/.config/yonedarepo/staging.env, name kept)",
        "VAULT_KEY    64 hex characters, shared with yonedarepo-dev-agents",
        "Run next to the data: a commit makes about ten round trips to its repository's",
        "Durable Object, R2 (ENAM) and Artifacts, so each costs a hop to the client's colo",
        "otherwise. New repository objects are created near the placed Worker.",
        "The dev superfan (wrangler.dev-superfan.jsonc) receives this Worker's tail",
        "events: outcomes, logs, exceptions and CPU/wall time, with no API token.",
        "Batched landing, with commits beginning from and main reads served by the published",
        "head. No LAND_MODE_OVERRIDE: per-request mode headers are for benches only.",
        "Check runs take minutes (container start, the check): one per invocation, up to",
        "the container limit (4) at once, apart from the derive and projection jobs above.",
        "api.dev.yonedarepo.com is the platform API's own hostname (Custom Domain plus the exact route, which wins over the prod sites Worker's *.yonedarepo.com route); WEB_ORIGIN is where people approve device logins (/device).",
        "Model checks call the review model with REVIEW_MODEL_KEY, the managed Z.ai key (Secrets Store secret ZAI, the same store key the agent Worker's managed connections use), bound to the platform Worker itself; it never reads an agent-layer connection."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "OWNER_TOKEN",
        "VAULT_KEY"
      ],
      "health": "yonedarepo-platform",
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-platform",
        "main": "worker/platform-index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "compatibility_flags": [
          "nodejs_compat"
        ],
        "limits": {
          "subrequests": 50000
        },
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        },
        "placement": {
          "mode": "targeted",
          "region": "aws:us-east-1"
        },
        "tail_consumers": [
          {
            "service": "{prefix}-superfan"
          }
        ],
        "assets": {
          "directory": "../frontend/dist",
          "binding": "ASSETS",
          "not_found_handling": "single-page-application",
          "run_worker_first": true
        },
        "vars": {
          "ARTIFACTS_NAMESPACE": "{prefix}",
          "LAND_MODE": "batch",
          "WEB_ORIGIN": "{origin}",
          "WORKERS_SUBDOMAIN": "{subdomain}"
        },
        "secrets_store_secrets": [
          {
            "binding": "REVIEW_MODEL_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "ZAI"
          }
        ],
        "artifacts": [
          {
            "binding": "ARTIFACTS",
            "namespace": "{prefix}",
            "remote": true
          }
        ],
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "WORKSPACES",
              "class_name": "WorkspaceAuthority"
            },
            {
              "name": "SOURCE_REPOS",
              "class_name": "SourceRepository"
            },
            {
              "name": "CHECK_RUNNERS",
              "class_name": "CheckContainer"
            },
            {
              "name": "OBJECT_PUSHES",
              "class_name": "ObjectPushQueue"
            },
            {
              "name": "COMMIT_SHARDS",
              "class_name": "CommitShard"
            },
            {
              "name": "LAND_COMBINERS",
              "class_name": "LandCombiner"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "SourceRepository",
              "WorkspaceAuthority",
              "CheckContainer"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v2",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "ObjectPushQueue"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v3",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "CommitShard"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v4",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "LandCombiner"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "containers": [
          {
            "class_name": "CheckContainer",
            "image": "./containers/Dockerfile",
            "image_build_context": "..",
            "instance_type": "standard-1",
            "rollout_step_percentage": [
              100
            ],
            "constraints": {
              "regions": [
                "ENAM"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "r2_buckets": [
          {
            "binding": "OBJECTS",
            "bucket_name": "{prefix}-platform-objects"
          }
        ],
        "d1_databases": [
          {
            "binding": "INDEX",
            "database_name": "{prefix}-platform-index",
            "migrations_dir": "migrations"
          }
        ],
        "queues": {
          "producers": [
            {
              "binding": "PLATFORM_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-jobs"
            },
            {
              "binding": "PLATFORM_CHECKS",
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-checks"
            }
          ],
          "consumers": [
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-jobs",
              "max_batch_size": 10,
              "max_batch_timeout": 1,
              "max_concurrency": 20,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-platform-dead-letter"
            },
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-platform-checks",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-platform-dead-letter"
            }
          ]
        },
        "workflows": [
          {
            "name": "{prefix}-platform-import",
            "binding": "PLATFORM_IMPORT",
            "class_name": "PlatformImportWorkflow"
          }
        ],
        "ratelimits": [
          {
            "name": "AUTH_LIMITER",
            "namespace_id": "{ratelimit}",
            "simple": {
              "limit": 30,
              "period": 60
            }
          }
        ],
        "services": [
          {
            "binding": "SELF",
            "service": "{prefix}-platform"
          }
        ],
        "routes": [
          {
            "pattern": "api.dev.yonedarepo.com",
            "custom_domain": true
          },
          {
            "pattern": "https://api.dev.yonedarepo.com/*",
            "zone_name": "yonedarepo.com"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "agents",
      "file": "wrangler.dev-agents.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Dev agent-layer Worker: the front of the dev.yonedarepo.com stack (frontend, agent API,",
        "remote MCP). It reaches only the dev platform, through",
        "the PLATFORM service binding (`/api/v1` is proxied there on the same origin) and the",
        "WORKSPACES script binding. Its stores, containers and secrets are its own. Executable app",
        "previews (cloudflare/apps) are off: APPS and APP_ORIGIN are unset.",
        "Only the cheap providers have keys (ZAI glm-5.3-flash at low effort, MiMo mimo-v2.6-flash);",
        "Codex and Claude have no binding and fail closed with PROVIDER_MISSING. MANAGED_PROVIDER_KEYS",
        "lets the owner bind those two store keys to a named account as managed connections",
        "(POST /api/admin/providers/managed); prod sets it too.",
        "Spend: the owner workspace allowance is set to 5_000_000 microusd after deploy",
        "(POST /api/admin/workspace/allowance); it is a total, not a daily reset.",
        "OWNER_TOKEN  dev-only owner credential (~/.config/yonedarepo/staging.env, name kept)",
        "VAULT_KEY    64 hex characters, shared with yonedarepo-dev-platform",
        "The prod sites Worker's `https://*.yonedarepo.com/*` route would otherwise win: on one hostname a",
        "route takes precedence over a Custom Domain, and the most specific route pattern wins. The",
        "exact route keeps dev.yonedarepo.com here without touching the sites Worker (the same",
        "pattern production uses for www).",
        "Sandbox runs (runtime sandbox-cli-v1): one AgentSandbox Durable Object per attempt starts",
        "sandbox/Dockerfile (Claude Code + yoneda CLI) with Internet off; SandboxOutbound",
        "adds the provider key and the project token. Model requests go through the AI Gateway named",
        "in SANDBOX_AI_GATEWAY (custom providers custom-zai and custom-mimo; one-time setup in",
        "docs/runbook.md). The sandbox clones from SANDBOX_PLATFORM_ORIGIN."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "OWNER_TOKEN",
        "VAULT_KEY"
      ],
      "health": "yonedarepo",
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-agents",
        "main": "worker/agents-index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "compatibility_flags": [
          "nodejs_compat"
        ],
        "limits": {
          "subrequests": 50000
        },
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "placement": {
          "mode": "targeted",
          "region": "aws:us-east-1"
        },
        "routes": [
          {
            "pattern": "dev.yonedarepo.com",
            "custom_domain": true
          },
          {
            "pattern": "https://dev.yonedarepo.com/*",
            "zone_name": "yonedarepo.com"
          }
        ],
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        },
        "assets": {
          "directory": "../frontend/dist",
          "binding": "ASSETS",
          "not_found_handling": "single-page-application",
          "run_worker_first": true
        },
        "vars": {
          "PUBLIC_APP_ORIGIN": "{origin}",
          "ARTIFACTS_NAMESPACE": "{prefix}",
          "CODEX_MODEL": "gpt-5.6-luna",
          "CLAUDE_MODEL": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "MIMO_MODEL": "mimo-v2.6-flash",
          "ZAI_MODEL": "glm-5.3-flash",
          "STARTER_REPO": "yoneda-website-starter",
          "SITE_ORIGIN": "https://{prefix}-sites.{subdomain}.workers.dev",
          "MANAGED_PROVIDER_KEYS": "secrets-store",
          "SANDBOX_PLATFORM_ORIGIN": "https://{prefix}-platform.{subdomain}.workers.dev",
          "SANDBOX_AI_GATEWAY": "{account_id}/{prefix}"
        },
        "services": [
          {
            "binding": "SELF",
            "service": "{prefix}-agents"
          },
          {
            "binding": "PLATFORM",
            "service": "{prefix}-platform"
          }
        ],
        "secrets_store_secrets": [
          {
            "binding": "MIMO_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "MiMo"
          },
          {
            "binding": "ZAI_KEY",
            "store_id": "3d9115d4fe864c54a792bcb790a763e3",
            "secret_name": "ZAI"
          }
        ],
        "artifacts": [
          {
            "binding": "ARTIFACTS",
            "namespace": "{prefix}",
            "remote": true
          }
        ],
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "REPOSITORIES",
              "class_name": "RepositoryAuthority"
            },
            {
              "name": "LIVE",
              "class_name": "LiveRoom"
            },
            {
              "name": "WORKSPACES",
              "class_name": "WorkspaceAuthority",
              "script_name": "{prefix}-platform"
            },
            {
              "name": "AGENT_SANDBOX",
              "class_name": "AgentSandbox"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "RepositoryAuthority",
              "LiveRoom",
              "ExecutionContainer",
              "SourceWorkspaceAuthority"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v2",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "AgentSandbox"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tag": "v3",
            "deleted_classes": [
              "ExecutionContainer",
              "SourceWorkspaceAuthority"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "containers": [
          {
            "class_name": "AgentSandbox",
            "scheduling_policy": "durable_object",
            "images": {
              "agent": {
                "dockerfile": "./sandbox/Dockerfile",
                "build_context": ".."
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "r2_buckets": [
          {
            "binding": "OBJECTS",
            "bucket_name": "{prefix}-agents-objects"
          }
        ],
        "d1_databases": [
          {
            "binding": "INDEX",
            "database_name": "{prefix}-agents-index",
            "migrations_dir": "migrations"
          }
        ],
        "queues": {
          "producers": [
            {
              "binding": "AGENT_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-agent"
            },
            {
              "binding": "CAPTURE_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-capture"
            },
            {
              "binding": "EVALUATE_QUEUE",
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-evaluate"
            }
          ],
          "consumers": [
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-agent",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-agents-dead-letter"
            },
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-capture",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-agents-dead-letter"
            },
            {
              "queue": "{prefix}-agents-evaluate",
              "max_batch_size": 1,
              "max_retries": 3,
              "dead_letter_queue": "{prefix}-agents-dead-letter"
            }
          ]
        },
        "ratelimits": [
          {
            "name": "AUTH_LIMITER",
            "namespace_id": "{ratelimit}",
            "simple": {
              "limit": 30,
              "period": 60
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "sites",
      "file": "wrangler.dev-sites.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Dev website previews for the dev.yonedarepo.com stack: cloudflare/sites bound to the",
        "dev agent Worker and its bucket. workers.dev only (a *.dev.yonedarepo.com wildcard would need an advanced certificate); the agent",
        "Worker's SITE_ORIGIN points here."
      ],
      "secrets": [],
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-sites",
        "main": "sites/index.ts",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "compatibility_flags": [
          "nodejs_compat"
        ],
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "r2_buckets": [
          {
            "binding": "OBJECTS",
            "bucket_name": "{prefix}-agents-objects"
          }
        ],
        "services": [
          {
            "binding": "PLATFORM",
            "service": "{prefix}-agents"
          }
        ],
        "observability": {
          "enabled": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "bench",
      "file": "wrangler.dev-bench.jsonc",
      "notes": [
        "Dev bench client (tools/fanout-bench/worker.js): many concurrent writers for the kit's",
        "bursts (items 8-10) and the webhook receiver boxes (POST /hooks/<box>) for the B3 gate",
        "(tools/staging/webhook-flow.mjs). No bindings to platform state. BENCH_KEY is set once from",
        "stdin (wrangler secret put BENCH_KEY) and kept across deploys; the kit reads it from",
        "~/.config/yonedarepo/staging-bench.env.",
        "The platform never calls this account's workers.dev, so the receiver has a Custom Domain,",
        "hook-receiver.yonedaai.org (owner approved 2026-10-27), on a zone without a wildcard Worker",
        "route (yonedarepo.com has the prod sites Worker's)."
      ],
      "secrets": [],
      "ephemeral": false,
      "config": {
        "name": "{prefix}-bench",
        "main": "../tools/fanout-bench/worker.js",
        "compatibility_date": "2026-10-07",
        "compatibility_flags": [
          "global_fetch_strictly_public"
        ],
        "workers_dev": true,
        "preview_urls": false,
        "routes": [
          {
            "pattern": "hook-receiver.yonedaai.org",
            "custom_domain": true
          }
        ],
        "placement": {
          "mode": "targeted",
          "region": "aws:us-east-1"
        },
        "durable_objects": {
          "bindings": [
            {
              "name": "HOOK_BOXES",
              "class_name": "HookBox"
            }
          ]
        },
        "migrations": [
          {
            "tag": "v1",
            "new_sqlite_classes": [
              "HookBox"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "retired": {
    "notes": [
      "The dev stack's previous names (yonedarepo-staging-*: Workers, container apps, queues, D1,",
      "R2, workflow, Artifacts namespace yonedarepo-staging), renamed 2026-10-27 without its data.",
      "No current name starts with yonedarepo-staging, so a prefix is safe here.",
      "Also the hand-written platform-dev stack (wrangler.platform/agents/superfan/eval.jsonc, deleted",
      "2026-10-27), by exact name: its Workers and what only they bound. The Basin pipeline stream",
      "of platform-dev (CHANGELOG) is not a kind prune knows; delete it by hand."
    ],
    "prefix": "yonedarepo-staging",
    "workers": [
      "yonedarepo-platform-dev",
      "yonedarepo-agents-dev",
      "yonedarepo-superfan-dev",
      "yonedarepo-eval-dev"
    ],
    "containers": [
      "yonedarepo-platform-dev-checkcontainer",
      "yonedarepo-agents-dev-agentsandbox"
    ],
    "queues": [
      "yonedarepo-platform-dev-jobs",
      "yonedarepo-platform-dev-checks",
      "yonedarepo-platform-dev-dead-letter",
      "yonedarepo-agents-dev-agent",
      "yonedarepo-agents-dev-capture",
      "yonedarepo-agents-dev-evaluate",
      "yonedarepo-agents-dev-dead-letter"
    ],
    "workflows": [
      "yonedarepo-platform-dev-import"
    ],
    "d1": [
      "yonedarepo-platform-dev-index",
      "yonedarepo-agents-dev-index"
    ],
    "r2": [
      "yonedarepo-platform-dev-objects",
      "yonedarepo-platform-dev-analytics",
      "yonedarepo-agents-dev-objects"
    ],
    "artifacts": [
      "yoneda-platform-dev"
    ]
  }
}
